# Persistence (Importou)

## Repository

- Write path and aggregate load/save.
- Interface in `domain/`, implementation in `infra/`.
- Works with domain entities (`create` / `restore`), not raw Prisma types in handlers.

## DAO (`*DataAccessObject`)

- Read models for queries/lists/KPIs (live-read aggregates).
- Returns plain read DTOs / Prisma-shaped projections — not rich entities.
- Apply `organizationId` filters for org-scoped lists.

## Mapper

- `toDomain(raw)` / `toJSON(entity)` between Prisma and entity.
- Keep mapping free of business rules.

## Money / ids

- Money in minor units (`Int`) + `currency` string.
- Ids: TypeID via `Id` VO.

## Do not

- Persist Metric snapshot tables in v1 (use live-read queries).
- Add `tenant_id` columns or Tenant filters.

